    "title": "（1）分层展开 A",
    "body": "\\((2a^2b^3)^2=4a^4b^6\\)，\\((3ab^2)^3=27a^3b^6\\)。所以 \\(A=4\\times27\\times a^4a^3\\times b^6b^6=108a^7b^{12}\\)。"
